# Force git to treat all .mjs/.js/.ts source as text. An older revision of
# plugin/scripts/write-contract-check.mjs contained raw NUL bytes (used as a
# regex placeholder in matchGlob — since replaced with `\x00` escape
# sequences), which flipped git's binary heuristic. GitHub's diff view then
# renders every subsequent revision as "binary" even though the actual content
# is text. This override restores text diffs.
*.mjs text diff
*.js text diff
*.ts text diff
